@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Register through Gateway
# @name register
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login through Gateway
# @name login
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Access Catalog Ping (Requires Token)
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/catalog/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Access Playlists Ping (Requires Token)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/playlists/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Generate a Playlist from the caller's own library
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/playlists/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Late-night drive through the city, calm but not sleepy.",
  "limit": 20
}

### Save AI Provider Connection through Gateway (BYOK)
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/ai-connection
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "Gemini",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash",
  "apiKey": "PASTE_PROVIDER_API_KEY_HERE",
  "openCodePlan": null
}

### Access Catalog Ping without Token (Expect 401)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/catalog/ping
Accept: application/json
